        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. ISOGRAM.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01 WS-PHRASE PIC X(60).
        01 WS-RESULT PIC 9.
        01 WS-TABLE.
           05 WS-CHAR PIC X OCCURS 60 TIMES INDEXED BY I.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        ISOGRAM.
        MOVE 1 TO WS-RESULT.
        MOVE FUNCTION UPPER-CASE(WS-PHRASE) TO WS-TABLE.
        SORT WS-CHAR ON ASCENDING KEY WS-CHAR.
        PERFORM VARYING I FROM 2 BY 1
           UNTIL I > 60 OR WS-RESULT EQUAL ZEROS
           IF (WS-CHAR(I) EQUAL WS-CHAR(I - 1) AND
               WS-CHAR(I) NOT EQUAL ' ' AND
               WS-CHAR(I) NOT EQUAL '-')
               MOVE ZEROS TO WS-RESULT
           END-IF
        END-PERFORM.